tart": 21.52, "end": 21.84}, {"word": " au", "start": 21.84, "end": 22.0}, {"word": " réveil,", "start": 22.0, "end": 22.4}, {"word": " sinon", "start": 22.42, "end": 22.9}, {"word": " tu", "start": 22.9, "end": 23.1}, {"word": " gères", "start": 23.1, "end": 23.32}, {"word": " les", "start": 23.32, "end": 23.46}, {"word": " urgences", "start": 23.46, "end": 23.92}, {"word": " des", "start": 23.92, "end": 24.06}, {"word": " autres.", "start": 24.06, "end": 24.32}]}, {"start": 25.44, "end": 28.16, "text": " Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour.", "words": [{"word": " Franchement,", "start": 25.44, "end": 25.88}, {"word": " mise", "start": 25.94, "end": 26.3}, {"word": " bout", "start": 26.3, "end": 26.46}, {"word": " à", "start": 26.46, "end": 26.58}, {"word": " bout,", "start": 26.58, "end": 26.72}, {"word": " ça", "start": 26.76, "end": 26.9}, {"word": " peut", "start": 26.9, "end": 27.12}, {"word": " te", "start": 27.12, "end": 27.24}, {"word": " rendre", "start": 27.24, "end": 27.42}, {"word": " deux", "start": 27.42, "end": 27.66}, {"word": " heures", "start": 27.66, "end": 27.84}, {"word": " par", "start": 27.84, "end": 27.96}, {"word": " jour.", "start": 27.96, "end": 28.16}]}], "text": " Tu perds deux heures chaque matin sans t'en rendre compte.  Trois habitudes pour les récupérer.  Un pas de téléphone la première heure, parce que juste deux minutes sur une appli, ça finit souvent en une demi-heure.  Deux, tu choisis ta tâche la plus importante la veille, comme ça au réveil tu attaques direct.  Trois, tes mails et tes messages, c'est à heure fixe, pas au réveil, sinon tu gères les urgences des autres.  Franchement, mise bout à bout, ça peut te rendre deux heures par jour."}